UnitSettlementReceiverConstructor
└── when deploying the receiver
    ├── given a zero transferrer
    │   └── it reverts with SettlementReceiver_ZeroAddress
    ├── given a zero origin transferrer
    │   └── it reverts with SettlementReceiver_ZeroAddress
    ├── given a zero origin sender
    │   └── it reverts with SettlementReceiver_ZeroAddress
    ├── given a zero token
    │   └── it reverts with SettlementReceiver_ZeroAddress
    └── given every address set
        └── it stores each address
